From 979dd2f72e87232151fc84de178e2895095de411 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zmerklein <z.merklein@4squaremfg.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:42:02 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Visualizer: colors follow the chord being played

Detects major/minor triads from a high-resolution chroma analysis and
steers the palette to the root's color (circle-of-fifths color wheel;
minor chords less saturated). Toggle with C.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_014T1vqddYBhYQ1teESwpE26
